---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="MAKHEX owner order exceptions" description="Private MAKHEX owner operations dashboard for sourcing exceptions and manual Squarespace payment link approval." noindex>
 <div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/">HOME</a><span>/</span><span>OWNER OPERATIONS</span></div>
 <section class="container owner-ops-page">
   <span class="eyebrow">MAKHEX / OWNER ONLY / ORDER EXCEPTIONS</span>
   <h1>Approve exceptions.<br/><em>Keep buyers here.</em></h1>
   <p>After buyers place a MAKHEX order, review unavailable supplier variants, special pricing and custom components here. Routine orders should eventually bypass review once their SKUs, U.S. freight and fulfillment are certified.</p>
   <div class="owner-ops-login">
     <label>Owner access key <input type="password" id="owner-key" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Private owner access key"/></label>
     <button id="owner-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-primary">UNLOCK ORDER QUEUE →</button>
     <p id="owner-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">Order details are hidden until owner authentication succeeds. The key is not saved in local storage.</p>
   </div>
   <section id="owner-orders-section" hidden>
     <div class="owner-ops-head"><h2>Order and exception queue</h2><button id="owner-reload" class="btn btn-outline" type="button">REFRESH</button></div>
     <p>**Approved** = sourcing and final total reviewed. **Payment link ready** = owner entered a real MAKHEX Squarespace checkout link. Only record **paid verified** after checking the actual Squarespace order receipt; no synthetic payment acceptance.</p>
     <div id="owner-orders" class="owner-orders"></div>
   </section>
 </section>
 <script is:inline src="/scripts/makhex-owner-orders.js?v=first-party-20261027"></script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.owner-ops-page{padding:3rem 0 6rem}.owner-ops-page>h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.6rem);line-height:1.06;margin:.7rem 0}.owner-ops-page h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#a65333}.owner-ops-page>p{max-width:66rem;line-height:1.7}.owner-ops-login{border:1px solid #d9c9b3;border-radius:14px;background:#fffaf1;max-width:850px;display:grid;gap:1rem;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}.owner-ops-login label{display:grid;gap:.5rem}.owner-ops-login input{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid #c9bdad;border-radius:8px;min-width:0}.owner-ops-login p{font-size:.88rem;max-width:50rem}.owner-ops-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.owner-ops-head h2{font-size:2rem}.owner-orders{display:grid;gap:1rem}.owner-order{background:#fffaf3;border:1px solid #dfcbb7;border-radius:13px;padding:1.3rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.owner-order .owner-status{font-weight:700;color:#325c46}.owner-order header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem}.owner-order ul{padding-left:1.2rem}.owner-order li{padding:.25rem 0}.owner-order-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem}.owner-order-controls label{display:grid;gap:.35rem;font-weight:600;font-size:.86rem}.owner-order-controls input,.owner-order-controls select,.owner-order-controls textarea{padding:.65rem;border:1px solid #c9beae;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;font:inherit}.owner-order-controls .owner-full{grid-column:1/-1}.owner-action{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem}.owner-order .owner-response{font-size:.84rem;color:#315941}
@media(max-width:720px){.owner-order-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}.owner-order-controls .owner-full{grid-column:auto}}
</style>